    <!-- How it works -->
    <string name="how_title">How it works</string>
    <string name="how_body">1. The app reads the texts of the Uber Driver screen through the accessibility service, or through a screenshot when needed.\n2. It extracts the price in Egyptian pounds and the distance in kilometres.\n3. It calculates: price ÷ distance.\n4. It shows exactly one of: suitable, close, not suitable.\n\nNo trip history, no statistics, no maps and no internet connection.</string>
